1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 34]</font>

15
00:01:22,560 --> 00:01:23,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Greetings, My Lady.</font>

16
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:26,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To celebrate your wedding,</font>

17
00:01:26,960 --> 00:01:28,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Grandlord has sent me with a gift.</font>

18
00:01:33,360 --> 00:01:33,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My thanks to the Grandlord.</font>

19
00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:41,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A dropped fan symbolizes a falling out.</font>

20
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:43,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A terrible omen.</font>

21
00:01:44,040 --> 00:01:45,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was careless for a moment</font>

22
00:01:45,360 --> 00:01:46,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and caused a disturbance.</font>

23
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:48,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I beg you not to take offense.</font>

24
00:01:56,920 --> 00:01:58,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're blessing my consort and me</font>

25
00:01:59,160 --> 00:02:00,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with many children soon.</font>

26
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:02,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is a most auspicious sign.</font>

27
00:02:03,280 --> 00:02:04,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could I blame you?</font>

28
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:10,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This gentleman has a distinguished air.</font>

29
00:02:10,520 --> 00:02:11,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">May I ask how to address you?</font>

30
00:02:12,520 --> 00:02:12,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling.</font>

31
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:18,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling is my betrothed.</font>

32
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:25,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've prepared some modest wine.</font>

33
00:02:25,600 --> 00:02:26,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I invite you both</font>

34
00:02:26,760 --> 00:02:27,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to join the meal shortly.</font>

35
00:02:36,240 --> 00:02:37,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The ceremony is complete.</font>

36
00:02:37,880 --> 00:02:40,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The newlyweds enter the bridal chamber.</font>

37
00:02:45,320 --> 00:02:46,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone,</font>

38
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:47,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the wedding banquet is ready.</font>

39
00:02:48,200 --> 00:02:50,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please follow me to the side hall.</font>

40
00:02:51,320 --> 00:02:51,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

41
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:54,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't that Li Congyao?</font>

42
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:55,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling.</font>

43
00:02:55,760 --> 00:02:57,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's a man and a woman there.</font>

44
00:02:57,680 --> 00:02:58,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Judging by their appearance,</font>

45
00:02:59,080 --> 00:03:00,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they are not from our Xizhao.</font>

46
00:03:01,520 --> 00:03:03,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They must be the escort envoys
from Beiyuan.</font>

47
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:05,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are also from Beiyuan.</font>

48
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:08,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Perhaps the one who poisoned you</font>

49
00:03:08,600 --> 00:03:10,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is one of them.</font>

50
00:03:12,880 --> 00:03:13,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

51
00:03:14,760 --> 00:03:17,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stall the sacred maid for me later.</font>

52
00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:19,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need to ask Li Congyao</font>

53
00:03:19,040 --> 00:03:20,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about what is going on.</font>

54
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:20,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright.</font>

55
00:03:29,320 --> 00:03:30,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leave it to me.</font>

56
00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:31,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My Lady.</font>

57
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:38,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is there something you need?</font>

58
00:03:40,320 --> 00:03:42,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Calling you "My Lady"
feels a bit distant.</font>

59
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:44,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">May I address you directly</font>

60
00:03:44,560 --> 00:03:45,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as Yaoji?</font>

61
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:47,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">May I know your name?</font>

62
00:03:47,960 --> 00:03:49,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am the escort envoy from Beiyuan.</font>

63
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:51,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Princess Minghua is my younger sister.</font>

64
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:54,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could you be Vice Minister Jiang
from Beiyuan?</font>

65
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:55,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's me.</font>

66
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:58,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well.</font>

67
00:03:58,640 --> 00:04:02,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wish to have a word
with you in private.</font>

68
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:04,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Would that be convenient?</font>

69
00:04:05,880 --> 00:04:06,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling.</font>

70
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:08,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go on ahead and wait for me.</font>

71
00:04:26,160 --> 00:04:26,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

72
00:04:30,640 --> 00:04:31,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss.</font>

73
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:32,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">May I ask who you are?</font>

74
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:35,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao.</font>

75
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:36,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop this nonsense.</font>

76
00:04:36,840 --> 00:04:37,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am not Li Congyao.</font>

77
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:39,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know you at all.</font>

78
00:04:43,960 --> 00:04:45,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even with that mask on,</font>

79
00:04:46,400 --> 00:04:47,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your silhouette,</font>

80
00:04:47,640 --> 00:04:48,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your voice,</font>

81
00:04:49,280 --> 00:04:50,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and your hands...</font>

82
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:52,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I could never mistake them.</font>

83
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:54,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why do you pretend not to know me?</font>

84
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:56,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After you left Jifu Village,</font>

85
00:04:56,880 --> 00:04:57,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what happened to you?</font>

86
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:00,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't touch me.</font>

87
00:05:01,840 --> 00:05:03,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know you at all.</font>

88
00:05:04,520 --> 00:05:05,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

89
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:08,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then take off your mask. Let me see.</font>

90
00:05:08,520 --> 00:05:10,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Only Yaoji can remove my mask.</font>

91
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:12,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To hell with Yaoji.</font>

92
00:05:13,080 --> 00:05:14,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am your wife.</font>

93
00:05:16,520 --> 00:05:17,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao.</font>

94
00:05:17,840 --> 00:05:18,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me back my mask.</font>

95
00:05:19,840 --> 00:05:20,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

96
00:05:21,880 --> 00:05:23,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She made you wear this mask</font>

97
00:05:24,200 --> 00:05:26,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to hide your identity.</font>

98
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:27,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She has a guilty conscience.</font>

99
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:31,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you giving it back or not?</font>

100
00:05:34,320 --> 00:05:35,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Qin.</font>

101
00:05:35,520 --> 00:05:36,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Qin.</font>

102
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:40,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Qin!</font>

103
00:05:40,880 --> 00:05:42,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His Highness
has been looking for you.</font>

104
00:05:42,760 --> 00:05:43,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should count yourself lucky</font>

105
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:46,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that you are here.</font>

106
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:54,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Qin, forgive me.</font>

107
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:55,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His Highness merely instructed me</font>

108
00:05:55,720 --> 00:05:57,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to check on your well-being.</font>

109
00:05:57,440 --> 00:05:58,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I saw you clashing</font>

110
00:05:58,480 --> 00:06:00,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with the sacred maid's betrothed,</font>

111
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:01,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I had no choice but to intervene.</font>

112
00:06:02,200 --> 00:06:03,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today is His Highness's wedding day.</font>

113
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:05,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We cannot allow any trouble
in the residence,</font>

114
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:07,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for it would be a terrible omen.</font>

115
00:06:09,240 --> 00:06:10,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you for the warning, Steward Wang.</font>

116
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:12,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That was careless of me.</font>

117
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:16,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's not tell my brother
about this yet.</font>

118
00:06:17,240 --> 00:06:18,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For now, let him</font>

119
00:06:18,440 --> 00:06:19,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">enjoy being a bridegroom in peace.</font>

120
00:06:20,280 --> 00:06:20,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

121
00:06:32,840 --> 00:06:33,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

122
00:06:33,440 --> 00:06:34,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aren't you reading my palm?</font>

123
00:06:34,080 --> 00:06:34,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why prick me?</font>

124
00:06:35,840 --> 00:06:38,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your life line is quite short.</font>

125
00:06:39,960 --> 00:06:41,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm helping you.</font>

126
00:06:41,880 --> 00:06:43,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The needle prolongs your life.</font>

127
00:06:44,560 --> 00:06:45,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that really a thing?</font>

128
00:06:45,960 --> 00:06:47,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have other matters to attend to.</font>

129
00:06:47,680 --> 00:06:48,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must take my leave now.</font>

130
00:06:48,840 --> 00:06:49,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Yaoji.</font>

131
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:51,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could you read my marriage line too?</font>

132
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:54,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So that prick was for nothing?</font>

133
00:06:54,880 --> 00:06:55,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

134
00:06:56,880 --> 00:06:58,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao claims he doesn't know me.</font>

135
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:05,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling.</font>

136
00:07:06,200 --> 00:07:07,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you felt a tingling in your hand?</font>

137
00:07:13,640 --> 00:07:15,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seems the catalyst isn't on Mr. Jiang.</font>

138
00:07:17,600 --> 00:07:19,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All my words were wasted.</font>

139
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:20,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've worked hard, Yaoji.</font>

140
00:07:21,120 --> 00:07:21,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For you,</font>

141
00:07:22,440 --> 00:07:23,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">nothing feels like hard work.</font>

142
00:07:24,160 --> 00:07:24,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My Lady,</font>

143
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:30,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">our spies have confirmed it.</font>

144
00:07:30,680 --> 00:07:32,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since the consort entered the residence,</font>

145
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:33,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Fourth Prince has never once
inquired about her.</font>

146
00:07:34,520 --> 00:07:35,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In the hall,</font>

147
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:38,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he was also cold toward that Princess.</font>

148
00:07:38,720 --> 00:07:41,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems the Great Emperor's alliance
with Beiyuan</font>

149
00:07:42,280 --> 00:07:43,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is nothing to fear after all.</font>

150
00:07:44,400 --> 00:07:45,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At the Prince's Residence,</font>

151
00:07:46,520 --> 00:07:48,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a woman called me Li Congyao</font>

152
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:50,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and claimed to be my wife.</font>

153
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:52,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did you respond to her?</font>

154
00:07:52,440 --> 00:07:53,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I said I didn't know her at all.</font>

155
00:07:54,320 --> 00:07:55,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For a woman to say such a thing,</font>

156
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:57,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she must have ulterior motives
toward Lord Ruling.</font>

157
00:07:58,160 --> 00:07:58,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is she the one</font>

158
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:01,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we're looking for?</font>

159
00:08:02,720 --> 00:08:03,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If it truly is her,</font>

160
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:06,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just kill her.</font>

161
00:08:07,880 --> 00:08:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go fetch the dagger.</font>

162
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:13,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling.</font>

163
00:08:14,080 --> 00:08:16,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That kind of woman
isn't worth your blade.</font>

164
00:08:16,640 --> 00:08:17,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From now on,</font>

165
00:08:17,440 --> 00:08:18,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you must not see her.</font>

166
00:08:19,280 --> 00:08:20,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I fear she truly carries a catalyst,</font>

167
00:08:20,960 --> 00:08:21,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and it could harm you.</font>

168
00:08:22,360 --> 00:08:22,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright.</font>

169
00:08:27,640 --> 00:08:28,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You may leave now.</font>

170
00:08:28,920 --> 00:08:29,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

171
00:08:32,240 --> 00:08:34,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I found this dagger for you.</font>

172
00:08:35,160 --> 00:08:36,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep it close for protection.</font>

173
00:08:39,400 --> 00:08:39,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling.</font>

174
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:41,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No matter what others say,</font>

175
00:08:42,400 --> 00:08:43,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">remember this.</font>

176
00:08:43,800 --> 00:08:45,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You will always be my Ruling.</font>

177
00:08:49,200 --> 00:08:51,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Double Happiness]</font>

178
00:08:58,880 --> 00:08:59,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His Highness is here.</font>

179
00:09:19,280 --> 00:09:21,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai, you're here.</font>

180
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:27,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I brought this local treat</font>

181
00:09:28,280 --> 00:09:30,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from Beiyuan for you.</font>

182
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:44,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The nuptial wine.</font>

183
00:09:57,040 --> 00:09:57,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well.</font>

184
00:09:59,040 --> 00:10:00,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What happened before...</font>

185
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:00,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Silence at bedtime.</font>

186
00:10:08,760 --> 00:10:09,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying.</font>

187
00:10:10,240 --> 00:10:11,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is your wedding night.</font>

188
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:14,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't bring up the wrong thing.</font>

189
00:10:30,520 --> 00:10:31,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's rest early.</font>

190
00:10:47,160 --> 00:10:50,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prince's Residence]</font>

191
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:50,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

192
00:10:50,920 --> 00:10:52,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you saying</font>

193
00:10:52,720 --> 00:10:55,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the red eye disease is not
a natural disaster</font>

194
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:56,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but a human-made calamity?</font>

195
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:58,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">According to my scouts' reports,</font>

196
00:10:58,520 --> 00:11:00,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the illness first appeared</font>

197
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:01,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at the most crowded</font>

198
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:03,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and busiest post stations.</font>

199
00:11:04,480 --> 00:11:06,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If we can find the first person
who fell ill,</font>

200
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:08,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we might get some clues.</font>

201
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:10,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Post station...</font>

202
00:11:24,400 --> 00:11:25,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you still remember his face?</font>

203
00:11:27,080 --> 00:11:27,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Draw it.</font>

204
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:40,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

205
00:11:41,080 --> 00:11:41,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Done.</font>

206
00:11:52,880 --> 00:11:53,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

207
00:11:54,160 --> 00:11:54,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">do you want me</font>

208
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:57,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to hire a tutor to teach you to paint?</font>

209
00:11:57,560 --> 00:11:59,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My style may be a bit rough,</font>

210
00:11:59,800 --> 00:12:01,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but it captures the very essence.</font>

211
00:12:02,240 --> 00:12:02,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look.</font>

212
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:04,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This mole is vividly drawn.</font>

213
00:12:04,920 --> 00:12:06,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I even sketched the hair
growing out of it.</font>

214
00:12:10,400 --> 00:12:10,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guards.</font>

215
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:16,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, what are your orders?</font>

216
00:12:16,840 --> 00:12:19,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This man was seen
at the Guanzhou post station days ago.</font>

217
00:12:19,640 --> 00:12:21,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take this sketch and send men
to search for him.</font>

218
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:22,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If found, bring him back discreetly.</font>

219
00:12:33,480 --> 00:12:34,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

220
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:40,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

221
00:12:41,680 --> 00:12:43,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I did help you out, after all.</font>

222
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:46,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then do me a favor in return.</font>

223
00:12:46,840 --> 00:12:47,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I knew I couldn't talk you out of this.</font>

224
00:12:50,320 --> 00:12:52,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is the Sparrow Token
my father gave me.</font>

225
00:12:52,560 --> 00:12:54,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With this, even the Chengtian Sect</font>

226
00:12:54,640 --> 00:12:55,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will have to consider
my father's standing.</font>

227
00:12:56,440 --> 00:12:57,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They won't dare give you trouble.</font>

228
00:12:58,160 --> 00:12:58,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

229
00:12:59,960 --> 00:13:00,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry.</font>

230
00:13:01,240 --> 00:13:02,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I carry the catalyst with me.</font>

231
00:13:02,880 --> 00:13:03,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yaoji won't dare harm me</font>

232
00:13:04,200 --> 00:13:05,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for the sake of the Prince.</font>

233
00:13:10,320 --> 00:13:16,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Chengtian Sect]</font>

234
00:13:16,400 --> 00:13:17,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today is not a day of worship.</font>

235
00:13:17,560 --> 00:13:18,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The sect gates are closed.</font>

236
00:13:18,520 --> 00:13:19,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please choose another day to return.</font>

237
00:13:19,720 --> 00:13:20,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What?</font>

238
00:13:21,040 --> 00:13:22,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Chengtian Sect opens
its gates every day.</font>

239
00:13:22,400 --> 00:13:23,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are they closed today?</font>

240
00:13:23,600 --> 00:13:24,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your sacred maid</font>

241
00:13:24,160 --> 00:13:25,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I share a life-and-death bond.</font>

242
00:13:25,760 --> 00:13:27,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just two days ago, she read my palm</font>

243
00:13:27,200 --> 00:13:28,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and used acupuncture to save my life.</font>

244
00:13:28,640 --> 00:13:29,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Open the gate, quickly.</font>

245
00:13:29,960 --> 00:13:31,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who dares trespass on our sect?</font>

246
00:13:37,320 --> 00:13:38,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Greetings,</font>

247
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:39,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My Lady.</font>

248
00:13:42,120 --> 00:13:44,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aren't you our honored guests
from Beiyuan?</font>

249
00:13:44,240 --> 00:13:45,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen to that.</font>

250
00:13:45,680 --> 00:13:46,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're honored guests.</font>

251
00:13:47,080 --> 00:13:47,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As I told you,</font>

252
00:13:47,680 --> 00:13:48,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the sacred maid and I</font>

253
00:13:48,360 --> 00:13:49,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are very close.</font>

254
00:13:49,680 --> 00:13:50,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lady Yaoji,</font>

255
00:13:50,640 --> 00:13:51,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">allow me to introduce</font>

256
00:13:52,920 --> 00:13:54,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Fourth Prince's sister,</font>

257
00:13:54,480 --> 00:13:55,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Qin Wei.</font>

258
00:13:56,400 --> 00:13:57,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The two of us</font>

259
00:13:57,400 --> 00:13:58,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have long admired the Chengtian Sect,</font>

260
00:13:59,560 --> 00:14:00,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so we came to pay our respects.</font>

261
00:14:01,680 --> 00:14:02,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yaoji.</font>

262
00:14:03,160 --> 00:14:04,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is the one I told you about.</font>

263
00:14:05,720 --> 00:14:07,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I heard, Miss Qin,</font>

264
00:14:07,520 --> 00:14:09,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that you clung
to my betrothed yesterday.</font>

265
00:14:10,240 --> 00:14:12,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you followed him here today?</font>

266
00:14:13,920 --> 00:14:15,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do all ladies from Beiyuan</font>

267
00:14:15,880 --> 00:14:17,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">disregard propriety like this?</font>

268
00:14:19,240 --> 00:14:20,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My Lady, you misunderstand.</font>

269
00:14:21,560 --> 00:14:23,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We came here</font>

270
00:14:23,840 --> 00:14:25,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to cultivate Zen.</font>

271
00:14:25,320 --> 00:14:27,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That requires
a spiritual root of wisdom.</font>

272
00:14:29,360 --> 00:14:30,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two</font>

273
00:14:31,280 --> 00:14:31,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have none.</font>

274
00:14:35,360 --> 00:14:38,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They say the Chengtian Sect delivers
all living creatures from suffering,</font>

275
00:14:38,200 --> 00:14:39,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">offering hope to all.</font>

276
00:14:39,920 --> 00:14:42,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why do you refuse to even let us try,</font>

277
00:14:43,160 --> 00:14:44,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and urge us to give up instead?</font>

278
00:14:44,800 --> 00:14:45,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can you say that?</font>

279
00:14:46,200 --> 00:14:47,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The sacred maid is merciful.</font>

280
00:14:47,960 --> 00:14:49,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could she ever discriminate?</font>

281
00:14:51,080 --> 00:14:52,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Spare me your nonsense.</font>

282
00:14:53,760 --> 00:14:54,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get lost.</font>

283
00:14:54,440 --> 00:14:54,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao</font>

284
00:14:57,120 --> 00:14:58,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Ruling]</font>

285
00:15:02,000 --> 00:15:02,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling,</font>

286
00:15:03,280 --> 00:15:05,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">don't offend our guests because of me.</font>

287
00:15:07,280 --> 00:15:08,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The divine cares for all living beings.</font>

288
00:15:09,880 --> 00:15:11,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All who come can find salvation.</font>

289
00:15:12,480 --> 00:15:13,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please, come in.</font>

290
00:15:24,400 --> 00:15:24,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

291
00:15:25,280 --> 00:15:26,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is this token?</font>

292
00:15:26,680 --> 00:15:27,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Sparrow Token.</font>

293
00:15:28,480 --> 00:15:30,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My brother begged
the Great Emperor for it.</font>

294
00:15:30,680 --> 00:15:31,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From now on,</font>

295
00:15:32,120 --> 00:15:33,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can go anywhere in Xizhao.</font>

296
00:15:34,080 --> 00:15:34,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one dares to stop me.</font>

297
00:15:36,080 --> 00:15:37,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your brother truly cherishes you.</font>

298
00:15:37,680 --> 00:15:38,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, that means</font>

299
00:15:38,400 --> 00:15:40,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you've long planned
to deal with that demoness.</font>

300
00:15:41,640 --> 00:15:43,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How dare she touch my man?</font>

301
00:15:43,560 --> 00:15:45,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll expose her for the fraud she is.</font>

302
00:15:45,360 --> 00:15:47,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right. How dare she mess with my woman?</font>

303
00:15:48,600 --> 00:15:48,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No,</font>

304
00:15:49,560 --> 00:15:50,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my brother.</font>

305
00:15:51,360 --> 00:15:52,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forget what I do at Beiyuan?</font>

306
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:55,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have 300 brothers
from the Court of Judicial Review.</font>

307
00:16:14,160 --> 00:16:15,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She meditates,</font>

308
00:16:15,400 --> 00:16:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you must stay with her.</font>

309
00:16:16,360 --> 00:16:18,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You shouldn't have to suffer
such an insult.</font>

310
00:16:18,920 --> 00:16:19,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A guest has arrived.</font>

311
00:16:20,400 --> 00:16:21,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It would be rude to neglect her.</font>

312
00:16:21,600 --> 00:16:22,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But...</font>

313
00:16:22,280 --> 00:16:23,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You may leave now.</font>

314
00:16:25,520 --> 00:16:25,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

315
00:16:30,360 --> 00:16:30,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling.</font>

316
00:16:31,800 --> 00:16:32,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am weary.</font>

317
00:16:35,880 --> 00:16:38,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Chengtian Sect truly is
a sacred place.</font>

318
00:16:39,720 --> 00:16:40,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No wonder the moment I arrived,</font>

319
00:16:40,720 --> 00:16:42,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I felt so refreshed and invigorated.</font>

320
00:16:43,600 --> 00:16:43,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

321
00:16:44,640 --> 00:16:45,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you feel the same?</font>

322
00:16:49,880 --> 00:16:51,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Chengtian Sect truly has
stunning scenery.</font>

323
00:16:51,560 --> 00:16:52,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at this grand waterfall.</font>

324
00:16:52,760 --> 00:16:53,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The flowers, birds, fish, and insects...</font>

325
00:16:54,200 --> 00:16:55,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shall we take a stroll?</font>

326
00:16:56,120 --> 00:16:57,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

327
00:16:57,800 --> 00:16:59,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're guests here.</font>

328
00:16:59,280 --> 00:17:00,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My Lady, would you care to join us?</font>

329
00:17:01,200 --> 00:17:03,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I knew you wouldn't refuse.</font>

330
00:17:08,920 --> 00:17:09,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never imagined</font>

331
00:17:09,880 --> 00:17:11,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that you and I share a bond.</font>

332
00:17:11,920 --> 00:17:14,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No wonder I felt
an instant connection with you.</font>

333
00:17:15,320 --> 00:17:16,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I truly hope</font>

334
00:17:16,280 --> 00:17:18,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we can become close friends
who share everything.</font>

335
00:17:20,680 --> 00:17:21,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Close friends.</font>

336
00:17:23,400 --> 00:17:24,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao, are you a fool?</font>

337
00:17:25,000 --> 00:17:25,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at Qinglan.</font>

338
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:27,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look what you've driven her to.</font>

339
00:17:30,280 --> 00:17:32,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The scenery here is truly beautiful.</font>

340
00:17:35,080 --> 00:17:35,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qin Wei.</font>

341
00:17:35,920 --> 00:17:36,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Drop the act.</font>

342
00:17:38,320 --> 00:17:39,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know who I am.</font>

343
00:17:39,960 --> 00:17:41,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whatever you had before,</font>

344
00:17:42,320 --> 00:17:43,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">right now, in Ruling's heart,</font>

345
00:17:44,160 --> 00:17:45,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there's only me.</font>

346
00:17:46,200 --> 00:17:47,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What did you do to him?</font>

347
00:17:47,640 --> 00:17:48,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does it matter?</font>

348
00:17:49,200 --> 00:17:50,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What matters is</font>

349
00:17:50,560 --> 00:17:52,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that he now does whatever I say.</font>

350
00:17:53,400 --> 00:17:55,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What meaning does blind obedience hold?</font>

351
00:17:55,760 --> 00:17:57,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then what meaning
does your stubborn clinging hold?</font>

352
00:17:58,640 --> 00:18:00,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He doesn't even remember who you are.</font>

353
00:18:01,640 --> 00:18:02,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How dare you slap me?</font>

354
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:03,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's you I meant to slap.</font>

355
00:18:04,960 --> 00:18:05,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao!</font>

356
00:18:12,680 --> 00:18:14,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

357
00:18:15,550 --> 00:18:16,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

358
00:18:17,220 --> 00:18:20,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

359
00:18:21,140 --> 00:18:25,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

360
00:18:25,820 --> 00:18:29,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

361
00:18:29,810 --> 00:18:33,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

362
00:18:34,330 --> 00:18:38,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

363
00:18:38,660 --> 00:18:44,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

364
00:18:46,800 --> 00:18:51,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

365
00:18:51,470 --> 00:18:55,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

366
00:18:55,520 --> 00:18:59,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
